      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The bullet grazes your forehead, possibly removing part of an eyebrow. Blood starts running into your eyes and mouth in a very distracting manner.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (1), @Condition[Bleeding] (1) and @Condition[Blinded] (2), the latter of which cannot be removed until the @Condition[Bleeding] Condition has first been removed. </p><p>No Extraction is necessary.</p>"
